  "id": "domain-identification",
  "term": "domain identification",
  "definition": "Domain identification is an early step in developing an assessment or survey in which the main topic areas to be measured are identified so items can be created for each area. In the source, it refers to deciding the key sections of the questionnaire before content validation and pilot testing.",
